  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gaza 2 Joint Response 2025 Sudden Onset</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funded by the Dutch Relief Alliance, the project will provide urgent healthcare and protection services, including essential primary health, maternal health care services and psychosocial support for IDPs and returnees in the Gaza Strip. The project will be implemented by sister organisation TdH Italy and their local TdH Italy PMRS. Three outreach medical teams of PMRS will deliver urgent and specialized healthcare for women, men, and refer children for PSS services, provided by TdH Italy, reaching an estimated total of 55,175 beneficiaries.</narrative>
  </description>
